        {
          "text": " “Aaishoo Papa pooki toki, nemeetae hoo obo oyiolo ina Kerai leme Papa ake, nemeetae hoo obo oyiolo Papa leme ina Kerai ake o pooki ng'ae ogelu Enkerai aboloki.",
